    "sections": {
        "description": "Blog Over News is a bold, news-focused dark child theme for Blog Over. Designed specifically for news portals, online newspapers, breaking news sites, and media outlets, it delivers a powerful 5-column hero slider layout with all front-page sections enabled out of the box. With its dark skin, vibrant accent colors, announcement bar, trending news ticker, featured links, category showcase, and tabbed magazine section, Blog Over News provides a complete newsroom experience. Perfect for daily news websites, regional news portals, political news, sports news, entertainment news, technology news, world news, financial news, health news, science news, education news, crime news, weather news, investigative journalism, opinion columns, and editorial platforms. Built with SEO-friendly standards, fast performance, and mobile-first responsive design."
    },
